# the working copy, newline boundary included. Born because a delivery
# sentence said "grew by appending" where the measurement said "inserted
# before the closing end Zi", seven bytes apart. Bitten at birth on both
# stated falsifiers: insertion-before-close BITTEN, pure append PASS.
sh audit/c4_artifact_prefix.sh || exit 1
